# The Dhan option archive — 272 parquet files, ~1.5 GB of vendor minute bars
# across the four moneyness stores, plus the index cache built from them.
# Rebuildable from Dhan; never a git object. Nothing kept these out before,
# they were simply never added, which is one `git add .` away from a 1.5 GB
# commit.
data/dhan_options/
data/dhan_options_e2/
data/dhan_options_m1/
data/dhan_options_m2/
# Scalp practice replay: one file per trading day, built by tools/practice/build_days.py
